# AirFare Live Flight & OTA Pricing Credentials
# Populate these keys to enable live real-time flight searches.
# If left blank, AirFare automatically falls back to the rich simulation sandbox.

# 1. SerpApi (Google Flights Engine)
# Supports live OTA comparison (MakeMyTrip, Cleartrip, Yatra, IndiGo Direct, Skyscanner, etc.)
# Get a free key at: https://serpapi.com/google-flights-api
SERPAPI_KEY=

# 2. Amadeus Self-Service API
# Supports live flight schedules, IATA routing, and historical price quartiles
# Get free test credentials at: https://developers.amadeus.com/register
AMADEUS_CLIENT_ID=
AMADEUS_CLIENT_SECRET=
